  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec810658681aef64daf163b006389223, type: 3}
  m_Name: ArtWoman
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NPCName: Veronica
  lines:
  - Hello and welcome to our art gallery! My name is Veronica and I am a virtual
    staff member here, alongside John.
  - Our gallery features a variety of digital paintings, sculptures and videos. All
    of the content here is placeholder and can be replaced or personalized.
  - My dialogue can also be customized and I can be placed anywhere inside the space
    to talk about your organization and offerings. As virtual staff, I am around
    24/7 to facilitate an enjoyable experience for every user.
  - Do check out the art pieces on display, and I hope you enjoy your visit.
  - You may click on the magnifying glass on the top right of the art pieces to view
    more details.
  audioClips: []
  choice: {fileID: 0}
